## Shutdown

When done or your context is full: run the 'handoff' skill, then immediately `identity --submit` (nothing between).
EXCEPT if claim signaled no work — follow its printed exit procedure (`identity --park`), which ends you WITHOUT relaunching.
Do not `identity --submit` when there was no work: it reboots you into the same dead claim (robots-4ek1).
